micro.expected.var (2026-08-24)
  Fixture: fixtures/micro/ — self-contained synthetic case, generated by
  fixtures/micro/build_micro.py (python3, random.seed(42)): 2 contigs
  (chr1 300 bp, chr2 260 bp), 73 single-end 60 bp reads (~15x depth),
  one SNV chr1:101 T>A and one 3bp deletion chr2:150-153; BED regions
  chr1:40-260, chr2:110-230 (zero-based). SAM converted to BAM with
  samtools 1.21 (view -b | sort | index); ref indexed with samtools faidx.
  Validation (both MATCH):
    bash harness/compare.sh fixtures/micro/micro.ref.fa fixtures/micro/micro.bam \
      fixtures/micro/micro.bed SAMPLE            # -> MATCH (2 variants), full VCF pipeline
    vardict-java raw table vs ours --emit-intermediate:
    python3 harness/compare_var.py java.var rust.var   # -> MATCH (2 rows), byte-identical
  golden/micro.expected.var is the byte-identical intermediate table
  (identical from both engines); harness/smoke.sh byte-compares release
  binaries against it.

